(173614,'https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3ARosogulla_(Bengali_Milk_Balls_in_Syrup)','en','CC-BY-SA-3.0','Wikibooks — Cookbook:Rosogulla (Bengali Milk Balls in Syrup)','indian',NULL,4,'Rasgullas should always be cooked on a very high flame.
