(27916,'https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3AVegemite_Sandwich','en','CC-BY-SA-3.0','Wikibooks — Cookbook:Vegemite Sandwich','australian',NULL,1,'Add avocado for an avocado and Vegemite sandwich.
