(470808,'https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3AEdible_Cookie_Dough','en','CC-BY-SA-3.0','Wikibooks — Cookbook:Edible Cookie Dough',NULL,'dessert',2,'The edible cookie dough can be stored in refrigerator for up to 4 days.
