(47380,'https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3ASushi_Rice','en','CC-BY-SA-3.0','Wikibooks — Cookbook:Sushi Rice','japanese',NULL,3,'A rice-cooker is often used instead of a cooking pot; these generally produce good, consistent results. The manufacturer''s directions will generally be similar to the above.
