(53521,'https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3ASemolina_Burger','en','CC-BY-SA-3.0','Wikibooks — Cookbook:Semolina Burger',NULL,NULL,3,'Adding 5–10% cornstarch by weight makes the patties looser.
