(6760,'https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3ALemonade','en','CC-BY-SA-3.0','Wikibooks — Cookbook:Lemonade',NULL,NULL,1,'Using turbinado sugar will result in a golden-brown color and mild caramel flavor.
