(75523,'https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3APotage_Parmentier','en','CC-BY-SA-3.0','Wikibooks — Cookbook:Potage Parmentier','french',NULL,2,'After cooking the soup, leave it to cool in the refrigerator for 1–2 hours. It will taste better when heated up to serve!
