(9082,'https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3AHard_Tack','en','CC-BY-SA-3.0','Wikibooks — Cookbook:Hard Tack',NULL,NULL,1,'You can add 1 tablespoon shortening to the dough if desired. This will make the crackers more palatable but means that, unlike traditional hard bread, they will eventually spoil, even if properly stored.
It is very important that hardtack has holes poked into it to ensure air escapes instead of turning the hardtack porous and therefore lessening its shelf life.
