In addition, a small piece of pumpkin may be finely chopped and added to thicken the sauce. It will cook away completely but will enhance the flavour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.5385),
